#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disarmed"
msgstr "Disarmato"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Figure out a stratagem."
msgstr "Escogita uno stratagemma."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "From Mission Control"
msgstr "Dal centro di controllo missione"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Your satellite has located the remains of the previous expedition. You "
"should come across a <a object|bbox>black box</a> not too far from there. It"
" will give you the coordinates of your next destination."
msgstr ""
"Il satellite ha individuato i resti della spedizione precedente. Nelle "
"vicinanze dovresti trovare una <a object|bbox>scatola nera</a> con le "
"coordinate della prossima destinazione."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Exterminate the few remaining ants. We've been notified that your neutron "
"gun is currently out of order so you will not be able to build new bots. "
"We're convinced that you're resourceful enough at this point to come up with"
" a solution."
msgstr ""
"Elimina le poche formiche rimaste. Sappiamo che la tua pistola a neutroni è "
"fuori uso, quindi non potrai costruire nuovi robot. Siamo certi che ormai "
"saprai trovare una soluzione con i mezzi disponibili."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<format key><key help/></format> allows you to review these instructions at "
"all times on your personal SatCom <button 63/>."
msgstr ""
"<format key><key help/></format> ti permette di rileggere queste istruzioni "
"in qualsiasi momento sul tuo SatCom personale <button 63/>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8 ../help/soluce.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "<a command>Controls</a> and <a cbot>CBOT Language</a>"
msgstr "<a command>Comandi</a> e <a cbot>linguaggio CBOT</a>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/report.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Satellite Report"
msgstr "Rapporto satellitare"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Currently in a geo-stationary orbit of Saari."
msgstr "Attualmente in orbita geostazionaria attorno a Saari."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/report.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "-> SURFACE<c/>"
msgstr "-> SUPERFICIE<c/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\tab;Temperature:      44.3C\n"
"\\tab;Atmosphere:       CO2, oxygen, nitrogen\n"
"\\tab;Wind:             2.3 mps\n"
"\\tab;Titanium ore:     none\n"
"\\tab;Uranium ore:      none"
msgstr ""
"\\tab;Temperatura:      44.3C\n"
"\\tab;Atmosfera:       CO2, ossigeno, azoto\n"
"\\tab;Vento:             2.3 mps\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di titanio:     assente\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di uranio:      assente"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/report.E.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "-> SUBSOIL<c/>"
msgstr "-> SOTTOSUOLO<c/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\tab;Energy source:    none\n"
"\\tab;Titanium ore:     none\n"
"\\tab;Uranium ore:      none"
msgstr ""
"\\tab;Fonte di energia:    assente\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di titanio:     assente\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di uranio:      assente"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/report.E.txt:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "-> ADDITIONAL INFORMATION<c/>"
msgstr "-> INFORMAZIONI AGGIUNTIVE<c/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\tab;Detected:         reusable derelicts \n"
"\\tab;Detected:         giant ants\n"
"\\tab;  - Danger:       ?"
msgstr ""
"\\tab;Rilevato:         relitti riutilizzabili \n"
"\\tab;Rilevato:         formiche giganti\n"
"\\tab;  - Pericolo:       ?"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Walkthrough"
msgstr "Soluzione"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "You should build a <a object|radar>radar</a> first."
msgstr "Per prima cosa costruisci un <a object|radar>radar</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The <a object|ant>ants</a> appear to be running away from you. Try to circle"
" around each one of them until they find themselves trapped between you and "
"a <a object|mine>mine</a>. They'll opt for the mine and blow themselves up."
msgstr ""
"Le <a object|ant>formiche</a> sembrano scappare da te. Aggirale in modo da "
"intrappolarle tra te e una <a object|mine>mina</a>: sceglieranno la mina e "
"salteranno in aria."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then bring the <a object|bbox>black box</a> aboard your ship. It is next to "
"the derelict spaceship."
msgstr ""
"Poi porta a bordo la <a object|bbox>scatola nera</a>, che si trova accanto "
"al relitto dell’astronave."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "<a command>Controls</a>"
msgstr "<a command>Comandi</a>"
